Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.85,0:01:21.03,Note,0,0,0,0,,（朝鲜 非军事区）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.58,0:01:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家动作快点 赶紧找到那个叛逃者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hustle up, guys. You've got to get that defector.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.08,0:01:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后带离这里 不要耽搁\N{\fnArial\fs30}and get the hell out of there. No delays.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.00,0:01:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,老鼠 准备好实现那个18岁目标了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Mouse, are you ready with that 18-year-old aim?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.88,0:01:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on it, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.40,0:01:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快 - 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Move. - Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.37,0:02:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊 这家伙到底在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, come on. Where is this guy at?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.25,0:02:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊 快啊 快啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on, come on. Come on, come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.47,0:02:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,老鼠 帮忙分散他们的注意力\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Mouse. Give us that diversion.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.56,0:02:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's move.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.85,0:02:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,火石 原地待命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flint, stay put.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.79,0:02:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人告诉你你打架超难看吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone ever tell you you fight ugly?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.91,0:02:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,被我撂倒的人不会说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not from their backs, they don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.62,0:02:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.12,0:02:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,火石 走吧 火石\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flint, let's go. Flint?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.75,0:02:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在搞什么鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.46,0:02:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,标记一下我们的地盘 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just marking our territory, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.26,0:02:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,大兵盖恩斯 看到火石的话 毙了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Private Gaines, if you see Flint, shoot him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.59,0:02:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,乐意至极\N{\fnArial\fs30}With pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.26,0:03:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到叛逃者了 返回撤离点 跟我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Defector in hand. En route to pickup. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.69,0:03:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没看到他 你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't see him, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.52,0:03:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,火石 快点滚回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flint, get your ass back to the team.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.11,0:03:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要撤退了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are on the move.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.36,0:03:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会相信的 拦路虎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ain't gonna believe this, Roadblock.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.54,0:03:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.09,0:03:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.43,0:03:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.35,0:03:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 这不公平\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no. No, no, no. Unfair advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.52,0:03:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我更厉害点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm better.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.64,0:03:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他脸蛋很光滑 连胡须都没\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got smooth cheeks. He's got no facial hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.77,0:03:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要拉引信了 - 在水里摩擦力更小\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm gonna pull the pin. - There's less friction underwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.82,0:03:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样算犯规 犯规\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a foul. That's a foul.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.99,0:04:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是特种兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Joe flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.45,0:04:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是特种部队的队员\N{\fnArial\fs30}A G.I. Joe flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.61,0:04:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这招不错吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a nice touch, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.20,0:04:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,算是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. You can call it that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.95,0:04:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你觉得呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what would you call it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.62,0:04:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很不光彩 - 也算是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Undignified. - Yeah, that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.79,0:04:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,赢了就该绅士点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know in victory, we should be gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.96,0:04:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杰伊 - 在\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Jaye! - Yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.05,0:04:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,普通人能屏住呼吸多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long can the average man hold his breath?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.01,0:04:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,90秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ninety seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.22,0:04:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给我来一瓶 - 没问题 老板\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Free hand. - You got it, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.68,0:04:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 放轻松 小样\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Easy, Flipper.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.02,0:04:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着 妈的 这就不行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back. Damn, that's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.52,0:04:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,胜利了庆祝一下很正常 这样才好玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing wrong with taking a victory lap. It's fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.98,0:04:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实就是这样 特种部队就像一个拳头\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is how it works. G.I. Joe's a fist.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.61,0:04:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就是指关节\N{\fnArial\fs30}Us, we're the knuckles.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.49,0:04:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要如何攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we strike?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.99,0:04:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,团结在一起才行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Together.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.53,0:04:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,若有一个手指没握紧\N{\fnArial\fs30}A finger strays…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.95,0:04:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就会被拗断 - 就会被拗断\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It gets broken. - It gets broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.53,0:04:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,又来指关节了 你不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knuckles, again? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.16,0:04:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,友情提醒 下次换个新的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a friend, you've got to get a new speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.37,0:04:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 下次你要淹某人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the next time you want to drown somebody,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.13,0:04:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得叫上我\N{\fnArial\fs30}just invite me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.68,0:05:05.31,Title,0,0,0,0,,《特种部队2：全面反击》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.80,0:05:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳米虫战争结束后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since the end of the Nanomite wars,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.14,0:05:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,上尉公爵·豪泽尔指挥着特种部队的战术行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain Duke Hauser now leads Joe Tactical Operations.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.06,0:05:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,麾下成员有拦路虎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Under Duke's command are Roadblock,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.40,0:05:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰伊女郎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Jaye,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.24,0:05:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,火石\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flint,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.57,0:05:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有蛇眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Snake Eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.45,0:05:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,而残暴的恐怖分子眼鏡蛇指挥官\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ruthless terrorist known as Cobra Commander,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.79,0:05:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,和迪斯特罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Destro.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.25,0:05:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经被特种部队抓获\N{\fnArial\fs30}have been captured by the G.I. Joes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.29,0:05:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,并被关押在守备最森严的监狱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and placed in a maximum security prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.80,0:05:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是眼镜蛇特工 白幽灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the Cobra operatives, Storm Shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.42,0:05:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,和扎坦 仍然逍遥法外\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Zartan, remain at large.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.88,0:05:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,特种部队和整个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}The unit and the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.14,0:05:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,都在高度警戒眼鏡蛇指挥官最后的誓言\N{\fnArial\fs30}remain on high alert following Cobra Commander's final vow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.81,0:05:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,全面反击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Retaliation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.58,0:06:04.28,Note,0,0,0,0,,（日本 东京）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.01,0:06:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,听风辨影\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ear that sees.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.43,0:06:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,岚影一族传承已久的测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}An ancient Arashikage test.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.15,0:06:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,金克斯 白幽灵的表妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jinx, cousin to Storm Shadow,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.44,0:06:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候证明你有能力加入特种部队了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's time to prove that you are ready to join the G.I. Joes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.54,0:07:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护好你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Defend yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.88,0:07:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了 盲大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm ready, Blind Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.00,0:07:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,耳听八方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ears, open.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.47,0:07:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,蛇眼 你来测试她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snake Eyes, your task.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.10,0:07:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,测试她的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Test her abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.85,0:07:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,拔下金克斯的一根头发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pluck a single hair from Jinx's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.35,0:07:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hajimate!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.67,0:07:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.26,0:07:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,要像猫一样敏捷\N{\fnArial\fs30}One should be as nimble as a cat,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.97,0:07:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要像老虎一样凶猛\N{\fnArial\fs30}yet fierce as a tiger.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.46,0:09:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,蛇眼获胜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snake Eyes wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.80,0:09:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,金克斯 为了在战场获胜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jinx, in order to excel in war,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.47,0:09:15.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你首先就要学会沉着冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}you must first find peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.81,0:09:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,蛇眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snake Eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.43,0:09:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你赢得了正义之刃\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have earned the Blade of Justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.77,0:09:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,此刀由黑色碳纤维打造\N{\fnArial\fs30}Made of black carbon fibre.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.65,0:09:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,凶残无比且坚不可摧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cruel. Indestructible.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.36,0:09:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,传言我们的敌人即将卷土重来\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are rumours of a new attack by our enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.87,0:09:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要离开道场 找出并阻止他们的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must leave the dojo to uncover these plans and stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.91,0:09:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,迅速行动 你可能已经晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But move swiftly. You may already be too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.84,0:09:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,正面遇敌 正面遇敌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Contact front! Contact front!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.46,0:09:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,敌人火力很强\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heavy enemy fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.65,0:09:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,守住防线 守住防线\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to bring them up the line. Bring them up the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.13,0:09:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 虎爷 但我赶不过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check that, Block, but I can't, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.34,0:09:59.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被攻击了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm taking rounds back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.47,0:10:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你的支援 现在就需要你的支援\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you! I need you now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.72,0:10:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,发动空袭 快发动空袭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Air strike! Call in an air strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.10,0:10:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 怎样才能发动空袭来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. How do you call in an air strike?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.35,0:10:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老天 - 我能不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jesus! - Can I bring…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.68,0:10:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,能不能用个急救包之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about one of those, like, care package thingies?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.98,0:10:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都快死了 就等着你冲过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm bleeding out and I need you to sprint.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.06,0:10:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,能不能用急救包 我可以给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you use a care package thingy? I can bring you one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.48,0:10:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,急救包\N{\fnArial\fs30}A care package thingy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.24,0:10:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁在朝我开枪 搞什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is shooting me? What is…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.65,0:10:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都快死了 你却在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm bleeding out right there and you're…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.33,0:10:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在原地打转吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you spinning?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.62,0:10:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得全方位掩护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to cover 360.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.00,0:10:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在原地打转\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're spinning.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.25,0:10:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你实战打得那么好 玩这个烂死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could you be so good at combat? You stink at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.88,0:10:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,别激动 我记得我的军衔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you need to relax. I believe I outrank you,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.09,0:10:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 比你高 - 别在我的地盘摆架子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- last time I checked. - Not in my house, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.42,0:10:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 敌军来袭\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Taking fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.84,0:10:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,受到敌人攻击 暂停 受到敌人攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enemy fire! Time out! Enemy fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.76,0:10:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,遇敌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enemy contact!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.14,0:10:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,公爵叔叔 你耳朵好大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uncle Duke, you have big ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.27,0:10:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你头好大 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a big head. Come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.68,0:10:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,回击敌人 现在怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Returning fire! What's up, now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.81,0:10:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,回击敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Returning fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.11,0:10:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,尖叫也没用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't scream your way out of this one!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.02,0:10:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,请求支援 虎爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, requesting assistance, brother Block!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.53,0:10:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,无法动弹 公爵 无法动弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pinned down, brother Duke. Pinned down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.28,0:11:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 我还有我的伙伴 地狱犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all right. I got my boy here. Demon dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.95,0:11:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,奶奶 帮帮我们 我们需要后援\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grandma, help us! We need backup!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.12,0:11:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不是你第一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not the first time you sent a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.48,0:11:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,让女孩子尖叫着逃跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}running out of the room screaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.96,0:11:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不是第一次让两个女孩子尖叫着逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not the first time I sent two girls screaming from a room.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.34,0:11:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟 这玩笑开得太不合适了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, completely inappropriate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.38,0:11:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 说说而已 - 太不合适了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm just saying. - Completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.55,0:11:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,总统被暗杀之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Violence continues across Pakistan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.97,0:11:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴基斯坦首都伊斯兰堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the capital of Islamabad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.30,0:11:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,持续发生暴力袭击事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}following the assassination of President…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.97,0:11:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为暗杀所造成的权力真空\N{\fnArial\fs30}The future of the country and control of its nuclear arsenal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.37,0:11:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个国家的未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}appear to be up in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.68,0:11:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及对其核武器的控制都成了未知数\N{\fnArial\fs30}as the vacuum created by the killing remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.08,0:11:36.68,Note,0,0,0,0,,（华盛顿哥伦比亚特区）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.70,0:11:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算巴基斯坦的总统死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Pakistani President may in fact be dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.20,0:11:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴基斯坦仍然是我们的盟国\N{\fnArial\fs30}but Pakistan remains an ally.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.04,0:11:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且是个主权国家\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a sovereign nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.87,0:11:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾经是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.29,0:11:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 那里不过是一个发生暴乱的地区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now, they're a riot with a zip code.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.13,0:11:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 我们在这里争论的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, every minute we spend debating this,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.76,0:11:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,骚乱地区正潜伏着已激活的核弹头\N{\fnArial\fs30}there are live nuclear warheads that sit amidst the chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.55,0:11:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能让敌人抢先拿到这些弹头\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't let our enemies get those warheads first.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.14,0:12:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,都有什么建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Recommendations?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.06,0:12:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,潜入\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.44,0:12:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,立刻潜入\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.61,0:12:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,静观其变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.24,0:12:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,狭路相逢勇者胜\N{\fnArial\fs30}History rewards the bold.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.78,0:12:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会当那个坐视不理的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going to be the man who waited and saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.62,0:12:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我把特种部队找来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me the G.I. Joes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.08,0:12:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,星际一号指挥官准备行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Star One Flight commander separating for drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.96,0:12:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,都给我听好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.92,0:12:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,核弹头应该就在附近 一抢到手\N{\fnArial\fs30}That nuke cannot have gone far. Once we have it,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.38,0:12:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,返回着陆点的途中就立即解除激活\N{\fnArial\fs30}we will disarm it en route to the L.Z.!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.84,0:12:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,弹头的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have its location narrowed down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.68,0:12:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这个导弹装配工厂内某处\N{\fnArial\fs30}to somewhere in this missile assembly building.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.10,0:12:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从楼顶进入 之后分开行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll go in on the roof, and fan out from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.31,0:12:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,火石 杰伊 如果别人需要支援\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flint, Jaye, if any support is needed,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.77,0:12:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们当援兵 拦路虎带领地面部队\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll reinforce as Roadblock leads the ground team.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.65,0:12:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.95,0:12:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,老鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Mouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.70,0:12:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我第一次跳伞的时候放了颗子弹在嘴里\N{\fnArial\fs30}On my first drop I popped a live round into my mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.95,0:13:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样牙齿就不会打颤了 试试看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keeps your teeth from chattering. Give it a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.33,0:13:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真好吃 - 好小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Delicious. - Attaboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.50,0:13:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰伊 敌人装备如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jaye, what are we up against?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.92,0:13:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,叛军用的都是卡拉什尼科夫冲锋枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Insurgents are armed with Kalashnikovs,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.67,0:13:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,SVD狙击步枪还有50式冲锋枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}SVD Dragunovs and Type 50s.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.84,0:13:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是冷战时期的古董了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cold War stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.51,0:13:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,别掉以轻心 还是能把你们打个稀巴烂\N{\fnArial\fs30}But don't relax, boys, still put holes in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.63,0:13:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿的是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! What have you got there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.43,0:13:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,P381黑风暴 全新的\N{\fnArial\fs30}P-dub 381 Black Tempest, just out of the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.02,0:13:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,可绕行 0.25倍速 远程遥控\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rounds. Quarter speed, remote controlled.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.98,0:13:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们什么时候才能有\N{\fnArial\fs30}When did we get these?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.65,0:13:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们没门 只有我们两个有\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't. We did.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.06,0:13:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,一流枪手专用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Distinguished Marksmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.19,0:13:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让我看看 - 手别碰\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let me see. - Don't touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.91,0:13:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,玩枪的女孩惹不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Girls with guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.45,0:13:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,接近目标位置 注意 做好准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Approaching target. Ten-hut! Make ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.54,0:13:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发 出发 出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go! Let's go! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.96,0:13:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,有谁想蛇眼了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone else missing Snake Eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.21,0:13:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟蛇眼在一起训练了六年\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trained with Snake for six years.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.00,0:13:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不在这儿一定有自己的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he ain't here, he's got good reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.13,0:13:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,大天使号 准备就位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arch-Angel, go for drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.30,0:13:59.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,虎爷 老规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brother Block, as always,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.47,0:14:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我们讲几句吧 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}would you mind leading us in a few words, please, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.14,0:14:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,引用一下Jay-Z（美国HipHop歌手）的名言\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the immortal words of Jay-Z,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.73,0:14:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论是何方神圣在指引我\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Whatever deity may guide my life,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.23,0:14:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的主 别让我在今夜死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Dear Lord, don't let me die tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.56,0:14:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,若只能止步于此 在我苏醒之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}"But if I shall, before I wake,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.19,0:14:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿接受我的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I accept my fate."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.78,0:14:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,大胆上吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.07,0:14:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,大胆上吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.57,0:14:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,大胆上吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.50,0:14:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,武器检查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Equipment check!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.83,0:14:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 完毕 - 完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Check! - Check!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.17,0:14:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 完毕 - 完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Check! - Check!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.42,0:14:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 完毕 - 完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Check! - Check!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.17,0:14:38.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 完毕 - 就当你的枪是偷来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Check! - Drive it like you stole it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.93,0:14:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,友情提醒 你需要一句新口头禅\N{\fnArial\fs30}As your good friend, you need a new catchphrase.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.23,0:14:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,A队 B队 通讯检查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alpha, Bravo, radio check.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.94,0:14:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.73,0:14:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,未被发现前不要暴露\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go in ghost till first contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.07,0:15:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 三队和六队到达一楼 - 收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Three and six on the floor. - Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.25,0:15:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,二队 大量敌人来袭 开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Team two, expect heavy contact. Bring the rain!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.83,0:15:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.92,0:15:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,三队 往楼上移动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Team three headed upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.76,0:15:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,东侧走廊已安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}East hallway, clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.40,0:15:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,二层清理完毕 正在往三层移动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Level 2 secure. Moving to level 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.54,0:16:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 欠你一个人情 老鼠 - 安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I owe you one, Mouse. - Clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.89,0:16:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到核弹头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right! I got eyes on the nuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.23,0:16:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,重复一遍 我看到核弹头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say again, I got eyes on the nuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.86,0:16:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我正受到攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm taking heavy fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.57,0:16:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那别动 我马上绕道过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit tight! I'm taking a detour!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.32,0:16:30.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 火石 照计划行事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negative, Flint! Stick with the plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.79,0:16:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,敌人已消灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tangos down!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.25,0:16:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.30,0:16:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,火石 报告情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flint, status!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.18,0:16:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.43,0:17:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,核武器已到手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weapons secured!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.81,0:17:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 弹头运输装置在四楼 - 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Equipment pack-up on level 4! - Set!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.27,0:17:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,克拉奇 到运输车的位置去 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clutch, station the transport vehicle! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.53,0:17:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有小队 准备撤退 抓紧时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}All teams, rally to transpo, immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.99,0:17:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,叛军正在逼近 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Insurgents closing in, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.70,0:17:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,二队安全 无人员损失\N{\fnArial\fs30}Team two secure. No losses.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.79,0:17:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 联系司令部 - 这就去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Contact headquarters. - I'm on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.12,0:17:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,快上车 我们撤退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mount up! Let's exfil.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.87,0:17:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 路线确认安全 - 快上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Run way secure. - Let's mount up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.27,0:17:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,核武器已解除激活状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nuke's disabled.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.94,0:17:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备进行远距离运输 大概19点到达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long-range transportation and wheels down at 1900 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.94,0:17:52.49,Title,0,0,0,0,,还能赶回家看《顶级厨师》\N{\fnArial\fs30}Home in time for Top Chef.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.69,0:17:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得漂亮 小蒂姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good job, Tiny Tim.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.28,0:17:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,任天堂的射击游戏玩多了也有好处啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that Wii Combat Shooter finally paying off, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.61,0:17:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 长官 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How you doing, sir? - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.87,0:18:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有特种兵都已安全归队\N{\fnArial\fs30}All Joes present and accounted for.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.37,0:18:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,报告下情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit rep?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.53,0:18:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经确认安全并且准备好运输了 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rendered safe and ready for transport, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.95,0:18:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞定后去喝一杯吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Square this one away and go get a beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.12,0:18:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那真不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.09,0:18:09.42,Note,0,0,0,0,,（弗吉尼亚州 蒙特克莱尔 总统行宫）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.42,0:18:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 核武器已找回并解除激活状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, the nukes have been recovered and disabled.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.54,0:18:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,特种部队任务圆满完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}All Joe missions successful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.43,0:18:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一些人员轻微受伤 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only minor injuries to report, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.68,0:18:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,运输队正在着陆点准备 凌晨两点撤离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Transport crews are prepping the L.Z. for evac at 0200 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.01,0:18:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得漂亮 上尉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great job, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.06,0:18:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正在修改你们的撤离计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're modifying your extraction plan back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.39,0:18:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,原地待命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.94,0:18:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 里韦拉 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, Rivera, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.02,0:18:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我直说了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me get this straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.61,0:18:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个周末\N{\fnArial\fs30}One whole weekend,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.44,0:18:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你照顾我的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}you looking after my little girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.41,0:18:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,行 只要我能带着这把枪去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep, as long as I can bring this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.12,0:18:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的很喜欢你的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I love your kids. I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.83,0:18:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她们太会折磨我了 你教女有方\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they live to terrorise me. You trained them well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.12,0:18:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那如果你赢了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you win?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.50,0:18:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须接受下一次升职\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to take your next promotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.42,0:18:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你扣一下扳机 我扣一下扳机\N{\fnArial\fs30}You pull a trigger, I pull a trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.42,0:19:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很怀疑你到底有多大能耐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if I'm gonna trust a pastry from a gumbo chef.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.14,0:19:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,风也是影响因素\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.48,0:19:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,7.5公里 从左到右\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four knots? Left to right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.23,0:19:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜湿度是62%左右\N{\fnArial\fs30}Humidity, I say, is about 62%.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.69,0:19:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还打算告诉我气压是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna feed me the barometric pressure, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.57,0:19:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,气压在升高 就像你勃起时的内裤一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's on the rise. Like your panties.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.41,0:19:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爱死我的内裤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You love my panties.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.83,0:19:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这笑话真是莫名其妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's an interesting choice of a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.62,0:19:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有这么多笑话可以说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of all the things you could say…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.42,0:19:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么叫「你爱死我的内裤了」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"You love my panties"?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.94,0:19:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能闭嘴吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna shut up?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.67,0:19:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 到底什么意思 - 你能闭嘴吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What does that mean? - You gonna shut up?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.25,0:19:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我在帮你 - 我这准备射击呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm looking out for you. - I'm trying to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.92,0:19:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我只是 - 闭嘴 给我闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I just don't… - Shut up, just shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.93,0:19:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 说说而已 - 给我 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm just saying. - Just shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.93,0:19:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的心跳多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's your heart rate?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.77,0:19:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个不算\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is not gonna count.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.77,0:19:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说话干扰我了 我要重来一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get to go again because you talked.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.94,0:19:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经扣了一次扳机 现在轮到我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You pulled a trigger. Now I pull a trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.86,0:20:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 不带这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we're not doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.45,0:20:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样做不算数\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is not gonna count.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.74,0:20:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你作弊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cheater.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.08,0:20:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给我女儿买了一台卡拉OK机\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bought my little girls a karaoke machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.91,0:20:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且她们特别喜欢通宵欢唱\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they love singing on it, all night long.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.29,0:20:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有宵禁 所以她们会玩通宵\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no bedtime curfew, so they're going to be up all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.34,0:20:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘了带耳塞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make sure you bring your earplugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.38,0:20:22.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们玩三局两胜吧 - 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- C'mon, best two out of three. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.30,0:20:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,三局两胜 刚刚那个不算\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best two out of three. That didn't count.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.51,0:20:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没告诉我你买了卡拉OK机\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't tell me about the karaoke machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.90,0:20:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zandar.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.48,0:20:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,总统先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. President.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.83,0:20:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是该保护我爸爸不被坏人攻击吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you supposed to stop people from shooting my dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.46,0:20:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,死秃驴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baldy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.92,0:20:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.00,0:20:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了 李·哈维（刺杀肯尼迪的凶手）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough out of you, Lee Harvey.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.30,0:21:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,快给我去清理干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go clean up the chocolate stains.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.55,0:21:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你留在你妈房间里的巧克力污迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}you left in your mother's bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.51,0:21:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,小猫要抓人咯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kitty likes to scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.85,0:21:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,有机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next time,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.35,0:21:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这个胖墩干掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}take out his fat ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.81,0:21:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,乐意至极 总统先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would be my pleasure, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.16,0:21:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I brought you some news.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.83,0:21:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,特种部队马上就要消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The G.I. Joes are about to be out of the picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.46,0:21:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,「马上要消失」的意思是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And by "Out of the picture, " I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.30,0:21:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们打回原形\N{\fnArial\fs30}alive on earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.30,0:21:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们太具威胁性了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a little too close to Mount Olympus.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.64,0:21:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须把他们赶尽杀绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had to strike them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.65,0:22:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会找到你的 扎坦\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll find you out, Zartan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.40,0:22:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他们找不到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.65,0:22:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是纳米虫的厉害之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the beauty of Nanomites.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.07,0:22:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 让你见识一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.46,0:22:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,完美无瑕的微技术\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flawless microtechnology.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.13,0:22:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.72,0:22:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,闲话少说 让他坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Recess over. Sit him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.76,0:22:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,都说当总统是吃力不讨好的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, they say this is a thankless job.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.10,0:22:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是昨天我居然和博诺（爱尔兰摇滚乐队U2的主唱）出去玩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But yesterday I hung out with Bono.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.06,0:22:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的新特勤处\N{\fnArial\fs30}My new Secret Service,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.31,0:22:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,想把美国宪法给烧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}they want to burn the Constitution.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.57,0:22:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,真心想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Literally.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.65,0:22:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我那些实习生\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my interns…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.15,0:22:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我把实习生都带回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, I brought back the interns.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.54,0:22:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道我最喜欢什么吗 可以随便炸东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know my favourite bit? I get to blow stuff up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.79,0:23:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是个讨人喜欢的做法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet that endears you to the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.04,0:23:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.30,0:23:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的支持率上升了9个百分点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your approval ratings climbed nine points.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.30,0:23:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然 美国民众想要一个面容如你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, America wants someone who looks like you,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.63,0:23:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但行动如我的总统\N{\fnArial\fs30}but acts like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.30,0:23:15.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这张嘴很能说哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the quicker blower-upper, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.56,0:23:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一个弊端\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only one drawback.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.23,0:23:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,想你的小娇妻吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The little wifey-pooh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.19,0:23:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你若敢动我家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you touch my family…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.48,0:23:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开玩笑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm yanking your chain.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.74,0:23:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当了两届总统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two long terms of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.49,0:23:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只当了几个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}just a few short months of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.91,0:23:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以就别浪费我剩下的这点时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let's not waste the time I got left.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.08,0:23:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,关押眼镜蛇指挥官和迪斯特罗的监狱在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is the prison that holds Cobra Commander, and Destro?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.33,0:23:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该问你 你葫芦里卖的是什么药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this where I ask you, what do you have planned?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.83,0:23:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道为什么大家都想做总统吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why does anyone want to be President?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.00,0:23:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为人人都想统治世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody wants to rule the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.18,0:23:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,各小队 带好行装 离开着陆点\N{\fnArial\fs30}All squads, gear up and clear the L.Z.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.56,0:24:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备撤离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare for extraction.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.35,0:24:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么叫拔出 我们是牙齿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Extraction? What are we, teeth?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.23,0:24:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 联系上总部了吗 - 还没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Reach H.Q.? - No, I got nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.23,0:24:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 到高处试试 - 明白 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go up high. - Roger, Sarge.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.40,0:24:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,虎爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Block.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.66,0:24:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人都归队了 一滴血都没流\N{\fnArial\fs30}All our men accounted for. Not a single drop of blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.20,0:24:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 完胜 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Boots to asses. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.41,0:24:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了 你擦伤了手肘吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except for that… Did you scrape your elbow?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.24,0:24:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没 红汗症而已 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, it's red sweat. - Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.41,0:24:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好是你打人后留下的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}That better have been on somebody's face.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.51,0:24:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,公爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Duke.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.09,0:24:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.47,0:24:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,保安部队来早了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Security's early.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.56,0:24:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 趴下 - 找掩护\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get down! - Take cover!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.19,0:24:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,找掩护\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take cover!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.90,0:24:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿起武器 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}To your weapons! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.66,0:24:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,卧倒 卧倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the ground! On the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.67,0:25:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,老鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mouse!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.79,0:25:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们赶出着陆点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get 'em out of the L.Z.!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.38,0:25:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要医护\N{\fnArial\fs30}Medic!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.55,0:25:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.14,0:25:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,火石被击中了 火石被击中了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flint's down! Flint's down!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.31,0:25:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我去救他 - 快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm going for him! - Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.27,0:25:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意10点钟方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten o'clock!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.40,0:25:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.24,0:25:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,部队遇袭 请求紧急空中支援\N{\fnArial\fs30}Troops in contact! Request immediate air support!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.49,0:25:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,重复一遍 请求紧急空中支援\N{\fnArial\fs30}I repeat, immediate air support!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.08,0:25:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事吧 快 我们得离开这里 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right? Come on, we got to move! Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.00,0:25:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧 受伤了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You good? You hit?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.84,0:25:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,虎爷 火石安全了 我们需要掩护\N{\fnArial\fs30}Block, I got Flint. We got to get to cover!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.92,0:25:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.51,0:25:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,敌机来袭 快跑 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incoming! Incoming! Go, go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.65,0:26:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,公爵 回话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Duke, come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.24,0:26:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,公爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Duke!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.24,0:26:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,公爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Duke!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.45,0:26:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,快找掩护\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get to cover, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.87,0:26:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 撤退 回集结点 - 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go! Pull back! Rally point! - Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.76,0:26:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,跳进井里去 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get to the well! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.17,0:26:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,快离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear 'em out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.88,0:26:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,撤退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fall back!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.16,0:27:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,检查完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.13,0:27:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.31,0:28:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道了敌人的身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have met the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.81,0:28:13.56,Note,0,0,0,0,,（美国总统发表全国讲话）
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.56,0:28:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,敌人就是我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he is us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.65,0:28:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天 世界精英战斗队伍 特种部队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today, the world's elite fighting force, the G.I. Joes,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.57,0:28:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,摈弃了他们的职责\N{\fnArial\fs30}abandoned their duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.91,0:28:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,打破了他们与美国人民以及把人身安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}and broke the sacred bond that exists between the American people.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.41,0:28:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,托付给他们的人之间神圣的约定\N{\fnArial\fs30}and those entrusted with their security.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.92,0:28:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,预备 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready and step.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.26,0:28:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,预备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready and.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.89,0:28:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}step!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.09,0:28:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴基斯塔总统率先遇刺\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first domino fell with the murder of the Pakistani president.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.52,0:28:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,刺客是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The assassin,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.56,0:28:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,一名特种兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}a Joe,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.27,0:28:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,代号\N{\fnArial\fs30}call sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.61,0:28:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,蛇眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snake Eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.57,0:29:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他并非单独作案\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he didn't act alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.91,0:29:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,特种部队企图利用当前局势\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Joes intended to use this situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.62,0:29:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,夺取巴基斯坦的核武库\N{\fnArial\fs30}to seize Pakistan's nuclear arsenal.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.29,0:29:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now this incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.83,0:29:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们清醒地认识到核武器带来的灾祸\N{\fnArial\fs30}serves as a sobering reminder of the scourge of nuclear weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.21,0:29:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,为此\N{\fnArial\fs30}And to that end,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.21,0:29:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我号召世界领袖们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I call upon my fellow world leaders.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.92,0:29:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上聚集起来讨论\N{\fnArial\fs30}to convene immediately to discuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.43,0:29:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,核裁军的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}nuclear disarmament.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.93,0:29:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我数三下\N{\fnArial\fs30}On three.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.72,0:29:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,一\N{\fnArial\fs30}One.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.23,0:29:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,二\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.73,0:29:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,三\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.56,0:29:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,特种部队的行为已明显越线\N{\fnArial\fs30}The G.I. Joes clearly went beyond the boundaries of their mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.53,0:29:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我的指挥下\N{\fnArial\fs30}On my orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.90,0:29:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个代号为眼镜蛇的秘密特种部队\N{\fnArial\fs30}a covert Special Forces unit code named Cobra.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.45,0:29:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,消灭了特种部队\N{\fnArial\fs30}terminated with extreme prejudice Joe Command,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.45,0:29:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,破坏其设备并歼灭全员\N{\fnArial\fs30}facilities, personnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.92,0:30:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,特种部队已不复存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}The G.I. Joes are no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.62,0:30:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.88,0:30:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里什么都没有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.89,0:30:54.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都没有了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing left here?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.22,0:30:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他不是那个意思 - 这里有我们兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's not what he meant! - These are our brothers!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.10,0:30:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是那个意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not what he meant!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.77,0:31:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,袭击我们的人还会回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever did this is going to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.74,0:31:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得转移\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.04,0:31:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在是我们的指挥官\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are our leader now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.75,0:31:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们向正东前进直到摆脱危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}We head due east until we're clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.18,0:31:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一定会找出是谁杀害了公爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna find the man who did this to Duke.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.22,0:31:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,和兄弟们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and our brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.68,0:31:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're gonna kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.31,0:32:13.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（艾恩萨根地下监狱）
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.81,0:32:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,蛇眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snake Eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.40,0:32:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,竟然能在这里见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last place I thought I'd see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.19,0:32:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是监狱长詹姆斯 很荣幸见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warden James. It's a pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.07,0:32:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可是你的大粉丝 我喜欢这身黑衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a very big fan. I love the black.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.87,0:32:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,很有约翰尼·卡什（美国乡村音乐歌手）的风格\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's very Johnny Cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.41,0:32:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 欢迎你来到艾恩萨根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come. Welcome to Einsargen.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.37,0:32:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来给你介绍一下这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me tell you a little bit about the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.04,0:32:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我 像个房地产经纪人一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me. I sound like a real-estate agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.96,0:32:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不是来卖东西给你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not here to sell you anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.92,0:32:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许只剩绝望可以给你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except maybe hopelessness.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.39,0:32:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,旅途愉快吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How was your trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.28,0:33:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始觉得头晕目眩了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sensation that you're feeling, your upside-down tummy?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.95,0:33:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们正在下降到前东德的一个矿井里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's due to our descent into a former East German mine shaft.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.79,0:33:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他们最深的一个矿井\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was the deepest they ever dug.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.12,0:33:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 你刚刚已经离开德国\N{\fnArial\fs30}So deep in fact that you just crossed out of Germany.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.29,0:33:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,进入了国际领地\N{\fnArial\fs30}into international territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.54,0:33:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也给了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which allows me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.21,0:33:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定的权限自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}certain jurisdictional freedoms.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.31,0:33:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,一句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}One word,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.06,0:33:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,棒极了 这个房间简直棒极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}awesome. This room is awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.73,0:33:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里的温度原本超过摄氏100度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Temperatures here exceed 210 degrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.48,0:33:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但人工降到了摄氏20度\N{\fnArial\fs30}when not artificially cooled to a crisp 68.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.40,0:33:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,都差点要盖毛毯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost calls for a Snuggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.49,0:34:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,看完下一个再惊叹吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait till you see this next one.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.42,0:34:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂了吧 这里简直秒杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}See what I mean? This just slays me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.50,0:34:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,太有趣了 这里就要用到科学了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so interesting. This is where science has come.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.67,0:34:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知不知道 在快速眼动睡眠阶段时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you know that during REM sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.93,0:34:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类的身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}the human body.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.01,0:34:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,会制造出一种神经化学物质\N{\fnArial\fs30}produces a neural chemical.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.93,0:34:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,它能够麻痹除了心脏和眼睛以外的\N{\fnArial\fs30}which paralyses every muscle in the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.77,0:34:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,全身肌肉 从而阻止\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the heart and the eyes? This prevents us.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.85,0:34:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们梦游\N{\fnArial\fs30}from acting out our dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.94,0:34:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这两人已被注入\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have injected both of these men.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.36,0:34:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,一种类似的合成物质\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a synthetic version.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.36,0:34:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们完全醒着 有意识\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're perfectly awake. They're conscious,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.11,0:34:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,能察觉到周围的一切事物\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're aware of everything that's going on around them.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.03,0:34:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只是被困在自己的身体里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just that they're trapped inside themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.87,0:34:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该认识你的新邻居吧 这是迪斯特罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I believe you know your new neighbours, Destro,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.59,0:34:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是眼镜蛇指挥官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cobra Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.89,0:35:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们三个就像是我的橄榄球梦之队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, the three of you are like my fantasy football team.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.93,0:35:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.40,0:35:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然你东张西望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now as your eyes and mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.90,0:35:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,心不在焉 那我就让你痛苦一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}travel to where you cannot, I want you to agonise.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.24,0:35:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你吃点苦头\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to pine.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.24,0:35:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你为即将逝去的自由而痛心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to ache for what once was and will never be again.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.91,0:35:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要让你觉得「逃走」这个词根本不存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to doubt that there was ever a word for escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.75,0:35:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.42,0:35:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么都不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.92,0:35:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,蛇眼说话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snake Eyes speaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.59,0:35:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然从没想过你的声音会是怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It never occurred to me what you might sound like, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.35,0:35:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我却构想过你的模样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've always thought about what you might look like.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.43,0:35:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱下他的面具\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll have that mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.95,0:36:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,白幽灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Storm Shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.79,0:36:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你把巴基斯坦总统干掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you killed the Pakistani president.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.12,0:36:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你并不是我的首选\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you're not exactly my first-round draft pick,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.13,0:36:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我一直都很欣赏你\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I've always been a fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.38,0:36:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,按规矩我们该发出求救呼叫 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Protocol says we make a distress call, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.72,0:36:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 部队都没了 规矩也就没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Protocol died with the unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.60,0:36:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.85,0:36:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,别人怎么知道我们没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's anybody gonna know we're alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.31,0:36:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不用知道 因为我们已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not, 'cause we're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.18,0:36:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于我们的政府\N{\fnArial\fs30}To our government,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.85,0:36:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,家人 特别是敌人来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}to our families, but especially to our enemy,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.11,0:36:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们凌晨六点在印度河谷荒漠被杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}we were KIA at 0600 hours in the Indus Valley Desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.32,0:36:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们至少得试试 也许有人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we have to at least try. I mean, there might be someone…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.44,0:36:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们现在做什么都要绝对保密\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Anything we do now is a rumour of a rumour.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.28,0:36:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有能证明我们活着的证据都没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any and all traces of our existence is terminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.74,0:36:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我所信任的也只有蛇眼一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only one I trust out there is Snake Eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.25,0:36:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时候袭击我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we got hit,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.67,0:36:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎样袭击我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}how we got hit,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.92,0:36:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,从一开始这局就已设好\N{\fnArial\fs30}we were set up right from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.55,0:37:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,能下令发动这种袭击的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many stars would someone need on their shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.22,0:37:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,肩章上得有几颗星 四颗还是五颗\N{\fnArial\fs30}to call an attack like that? Four? Five?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.72,0:37:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是肩章上有星的 是衣服上有扣子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not stars. Buttons on his suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.72,0:37:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是国家安全顾问 或者国防部长\N{\fnArial\fs30}National Security Advisor. Secretary of Defence.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.60,0:37:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 能发动这种袭击的只有一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. There's only one man who could authorise a strike like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.73,0:37:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还给他投过票\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I voted for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.86,0:37:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼镜蛇指挥官生命体征稳定\N{\fnArial\fs30}All vitals on Cobra Commander are steady.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.96,0:37:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,神经抑制剂已注入白幽灵体内\N{\fnArial\fs30}Storm Shadow nerve prohibitors injected.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.47,0:37:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,摄氏17度 变化幅度4%\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sixty-two degrees on a change of 4%.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.02,0:38:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 空袭 - 趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Aerial threat! - Down!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.01,0:39:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.96,0:39:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,心脏停了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full arrest!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.38,0:39:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 这不是演习 把手铐拿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quickly! No drill! Bring the restraints!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.17,0:39:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开容器盖子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remove the containment lid!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.93,0:39:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,血清在哪里 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the serum? Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.31,0:39:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,肾上腺素 快点 肾上腺素\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adrenaline now. Now! Adrenaline!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.85,0:39:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go! Quickly, quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.23,0:40:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要磨叽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.56,0:40:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,血清在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the serum?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.03,0:40:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,快上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.37,0:40:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,到后面去 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peel back! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.53,0:40:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么叫他没有心跳了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, his heart stopped beating?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.45,0:40:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非我下令 这里不准有人死掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one here dies unless I say so!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.87,0:40:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.21,0:40:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.71,0:40:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,快开枪 开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.22,0:40:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他拿下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.68,0:40:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他拿下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.27,0:41:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,北边没有异常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear on the north!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.10,0:41:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.29,0:41:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.30,0:43:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,停住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.05,0:43:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许让人活着走出那扇门\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shoot anything that walks through that door!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.97,0:43:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,都给我毙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.97,0:43:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,白幽灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Storm Shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.98,0:43:30.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,真靠得住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never a doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.94,0:43:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼镜蛇指挥官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cobra Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.74,0:43:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪斯特罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destro.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.99,0:43:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你出局了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're out of the band.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.07,0:43:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,出来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.58,0:43:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,快出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.01,0:44:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你找了人来接应\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you've arranged transportation.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.57,0:44:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在早上9点前炸掉的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Making more things go boom by 9:00 a.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.69,0:44:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,比其他人一天能炸掉的还多\N{\fnArial\fs30}than most people do all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.86,0:44:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,萤火虫 很高兴见到你 老伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Firefly. Good to see you, old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.62,0:44:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.74,0:44:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,可就是有人不让我进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some people just didn't want to let me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.33,0:44:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我逃出过八座监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I busted out of eight prisons.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.79,0:44:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,闯监狱还是第一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I only broke into one.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.38,0:44:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有通信已被切断\N{\fnArial\fs30}All communications have been cut off.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.36,0:44:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人会知道你不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one will know you're even missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.19,0:45:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他带去山里治疗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take him to the mountains to heal.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.44,0:45:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,在接下来要发动的战争里 还用得着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll need him for the war I'm about to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.23,0:45:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想帮你的忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.12,0:45:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,白幽灵受伤了 我们清楚他要去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've seen Storm's injuries. We know where he's headed.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.17,0:46:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you need me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.55,0:46:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.68,0:46:17.94,Note,0,0,0,0,,（宙斯工业综合体）
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.44,0:46:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 发射操控中心就快建好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, launch controls are nearly up.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.51,0:46:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直是主管在主持大局\N{\fnArial\fs30}The director was running behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.70,0:46:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里再也不归他管了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he ain't running behind no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.90,0:46:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,其它地方也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or anywhere else, for that matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.54,0:46:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,盔甲已按您的要求制作完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Armour prototype is complete to your specs.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.70,0:46:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今天把马力加到了60\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it up to 60 on the dyno today.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.83,0:46:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,它的名字您一定喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll like this. Working title,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.83,0:46:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,高速哨兵 HISS\N{\fnArial\fs30}High Speed Sentry. HISS.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.75,0:46:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎您回来 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good to have you back, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.97,0:46:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,很美吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't she a beauty?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.97,0:46:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个世界很快就会臣服于宙斯的脚下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon the world will cower in the face of Zeus.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.77,0:47:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在只差我们的指挥官了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All we've been missing is our Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.41,0:47:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,面具不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.12,0:47:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人迟到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone took his time.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.46,0:47:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,要从那个又大又白 有11间卧室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not easy to sneak out of that big, white,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.63,0:47:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,35个半浴室的房子里溜出来很不容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}11-bedroom, 35-and-a-half bath…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.42,0:47:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘了是谁帮你坐到现在的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just don't forget who put you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.80,0:47:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,也别忘了你的卑贱出身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or the rock you crawled out from.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.93,0:47:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,萤火虫 还好我们的疯狂不减当年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Firefly. It's good to know we're not running low on crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.14,0:47:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,十只手指还健全吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still all 10 fingers?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.10,0:47:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,前任总统怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is our former President?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.94,0:47:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他价值连城\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is worth his weight in platinum.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.52,0:47:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人说当总统很无聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, they call it a waterboard,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.19,0:47:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我一点都不觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I never get bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.45,0:47:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,48小时后 宙斯就能发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}In 48 hours, Zeus will launch.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.12,0:47:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个小问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just one wrinkle.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.79,0:48:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,有三个特种兵在这次围剿中逃生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three Joes somehow survived our little house cleaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.37,0:48:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,无人机在印度河谷捕捉到了他们的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}A drone picked up voiceprints in the Indus Valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.29,0:48:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还能指望你办成什么事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I trust you with nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.46,0:48:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会露出马脚的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll slip up.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.97,0:48:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦露出马脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when they do,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.55,0:48:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就去解决他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll hunt them to ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.64,0:48:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 你们看着\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, it's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.80,0:48:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.36,0:48:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,迷路了吗 小朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lost, little man?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.60,0:48:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我没迷路\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I ain't lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.48,0:48:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你走错路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you got the wrong street.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.60,0:48:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是带着麦莉·赛勒斯（美国女演员）\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why don't you take Miley Cyrus.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.52,0:48:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,和瑞安·西克雷斯特（美国电视节目主持）\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Ryan Seacrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.08,0:48:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,往回走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and head back that way?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.48,0:48:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我走这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.64,0:48:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.84,0:48:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.04,0:49:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好吧 马文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead, Marvin.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.68,0:49:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 别这样叫我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, don't call me that name.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.08,0:49:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧 小马文\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up? Little Marvin!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.68,0:49:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 马文？- 现在是大马文了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Marvin? - Big Marvin now.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.12,0:49:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你吓到了嘛 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had you worried for a minute, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.94,0:49:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,当心你的包 被抢走就不好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch your handbag there, boy. You don't want them to get you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.82,0:49:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看看你 块头这么大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at you. You got grown.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.28,0:49:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸妈怎么让你长那么壮的啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}How your parents make a kid this big, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.37,0:49:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他父母都只有1米57 - 真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- His parents are like 5'2" apiece. - Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.58,0:49:20.20,Title,0,0,0,0,,你按《90天魔鬼训练法》训练了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're taking that P90X serious, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.41,0:49:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,一周练两次呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twice a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.66,0:49:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧你脖子那么粗就知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see. Look at the size of your neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.58,0:49:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来介绍一下 这是火石\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me introduce you. This is Flint.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.38,0:49:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}What up?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.92,0:49:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰伊女郎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Jaye.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.13,0:49:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰伊女郎 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Jaye. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.84,0:49:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 欢迎回来 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Welcome back. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.51,0:49:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,遇到困难时就会回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what happens when you're in trouble, you come home.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.59,0:49:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,家就是避风港\N{\fnArial\fs30}Home is where the help is.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.80,0:49:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.26,0:49:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会帮你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.93,0:49:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们去娱乐中心住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Set up at the rec centre.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.56,0:49:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,避避风头 没人会来打扰你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lay low over there. Nobody gonna bother you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.31,0:49:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,要用车的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}As far as wheels go,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.48,0:49:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,就用我的卡车吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna let you roll my truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.48,0:49:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.32,0:49:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前我就是开这车去收保护费的 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got payments on that truck, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.82,0:49:52.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱不像以前那样好赚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't get it like I used to. All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.86,0:49:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢了 斯多普\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Stoop.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.65,0:49:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我欠你一个人情 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I owe you one, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.66,0:49:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 你欠了两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, you owe me two.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.83,0:50:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那次不算\N{\fnArial\fs30}That other one don't count.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.75,0:50:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎回家 马文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome home, Marvin.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.00,0:50:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意脚下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch your step.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.67,0:50:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里很多年没人来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one's been here for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.99,0:50:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这暂时就是我们的窝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is gonna have to be our pit for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.72,0:50:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这还真乱得跟狗窝一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. It's an actual pit.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.19,0:50:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前经常来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my old stomping ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.94,0:50:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们真的可以信任这个斯多普吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure we can trust this Stoop guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.94,0:50:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯多普不是天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stoop's no angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.94,0:50:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他是家人 可以信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he is family and we can trust him.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.70,0:50:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会不会被追踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we be traced?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.37,0:50:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以将IP地址隐藏起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can mask our IP addresses.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.29,0:50:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会每六小时发送一次加密信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll cyber-blast an encoded beacon every six hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.96,0:50:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有特种兵幸存下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If any Joes did survive,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.46,0:50:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得让他知道我们在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}we need to let them know where we're at.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.79,0:50:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Well, let's get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.25,0:50:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,火石 列出我们所剩的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flint, inventory every piece of equipment we got left.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.55,0:50:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰伊 开始调查总统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jaye, start that database on our President.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.76,0:51:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得知道总司令到底怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find out what's going on with our Commander-in-Chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.55,0:51:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的所作所为不像我们所认识的总统\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not acting like the man we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.65,0:51:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,找出这个原因 我们就能恢复身份了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We find out why, we can start being soldiers again.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.70,0:52:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰伊女郎中尉 请求紧急救援\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lieutenant Lady Jaye, requesting immediate aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.04,0:52:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有任何幸存下来的特种兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}If any Joes have survived…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.54,0:52:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个频道只有特种兵能收到对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This channel's restricted to Joes, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.37,0:52:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,波多马克河的西面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Magnetic west of the Potomac.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.54,0:52:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.88,0:52:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是杰伊女郎中尉 请求紧急救援\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Lieutenant Lady Jaye requesting immediate aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.46,0:52:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰伊女郎中尉 我们是金克斯和蛇眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lieutenant Lady Jaye, this is Jinx and Snake Eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.26,0:52:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正在追捕白幽灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are in pursuit of Storm Shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.81,0:52:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,即便蛇眼和金克斯抓到了白幽灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if Snake Eyes and Jinx grab Storm,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.77,0:52:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们也还在地球的另一边\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're still halfway around the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.23,0:52:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只能靠自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're on our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.73,0:52:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,足够打一场战役了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough for a battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.07,0:52:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不够打一场战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a war.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.24,0:52:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要打的是场硬仗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're fighting uphill here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.83,0:52:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我14岁来到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came here when I was 14.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.28,0:52:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前以为只能活到13岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a life expectancy of 13.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.83,0:52:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从一个家迁到另一个家 直到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was bounced around from home to home, until this.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.83,0:52:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,成为了我的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}became my home.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.46,0:52:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些人在门口排着队找我打架\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys were lined up outside that door to fight me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.51,0:53:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮包骨的我被揍得多了 就乐在其中了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They whooped my skinny ass so much I started to enjoy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.43,0:53:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到有一年冬天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Till one winter,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.68,0:53:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我长高了20公分 重了27公斤\N{\fnArial\fs30}I grew 8 inches and gained 60 pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.68,0:53:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把一个人打得连胳膊都抬不起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I punched a guy so hard he couldn't move his arm to tap out.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.35,0:53:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来特种部队来这一带招人的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then when the Joes came recruiting to the hood,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.81,0:53:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经将他们中的一半人都打倒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd already beaten down half of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.69,0:53:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我成为了一名实地作战的特种兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I became a Joe to serve. In the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.24,0:53:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以如果我们打的是硬仗 那就硬打吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if we're fighting uphill, we take the hill.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.37,0:53:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我查到一些你们感兴趣的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I got something you'll want to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.12,0:53:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我调查总统的时候发现了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}During my check of the President, look what I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.38,0:53:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是8月9日的总统\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the President on August 9th.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.05,0:53:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,对海外能源的依赖\N{\fnArial\fs30}an addiction to offshore energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.13,0:53:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,令我们某种程度上被迫卷入了\N{\fnArial\fs30}where we're forced to be kind of embroiled.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.09,0:53:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,外国的内政之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the affairs of foreign nations.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.14,0:53:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是10天后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is 10 days later.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.35,0:53:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 不然我们就有点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, otherwise, we're sort of…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.52,0:53:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是讲话中的补白\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are conversational fillers.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.44,0:53:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会蹦出一些无实意的词以使大脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little phrases we spit out to give our brain a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.40,0:53:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,能赶上嘴巴 比如\N{\fnArial\fs30}to catch up with our mouth. Like…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.94,0:54:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 「比如」这个词 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Like. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.53,0:54:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那总统怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And our President?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.11,0:54:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,8月9日到19日之间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Between August 9th and August 19th,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.45,0:54:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不再使用「你知道」「某种程度」\N{\fnArial\fs30}he stopped using "you know" and "kind of"
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.03,0:54:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,转而使用「我是说」「有点」\N{\fnArial\fs30}and started using "I mean" and "sort of."
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.53,0:54:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不止这些 「晚饭」变成了「晚餐」\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's not all."Supper" became "dinner."
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.95,0:54:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,「苏打水」换成了「汽水」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Soda" became "pop."
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.83,0:54:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个总统 行为却不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}One President, two fingerprints.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.67,0:54:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过这也就几句话而已吧 这能…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's a few words, right? I mean, how much can…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.63,0:54:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.67,0:54:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,两次新闻发布会 7月31日 9月1日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two press conferences, July 31st, September 1st.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.51,0:54:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到他手指交叉的方式了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}See his fingers clasped?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.01,0:54:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,一张左手拇指在上 一张右手拇指在上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Left thumb on top versus right thumb on top.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.39,0:54:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,同一个人绝不会有两种交叉方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}The same person never does this differently,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.26,0:54:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉会不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}it feels wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.52,0:54:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有可能现在的总统\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if the President.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.52,0:54:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是总统本人\N{\fnArial\fs30}isn't the President?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.36,0:54:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们的总司令是假的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, if the Commander-in-Chief is an imposter.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.19,0:54:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,下令袭击的人又是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he's the one that ordered the attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.86,0:54:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就必须假定任何人都不可信\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have to assume that there's no one we can trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.03,0:54:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个人可信\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is one man.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.83,0:54:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,特种部队的名称就是由他而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the reason we call ourselves Joes.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.90,0:55:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.58,0:55:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要两盒薄荷巧克力 一盒查克拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take two cases of Thin Mints and a box of Chuckle Lucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.92,0:55:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lower your weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.59,0:55:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,科尔顿将军 请允许我\N{\fnArial\fs30}General Colton, if I may…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.22,0:55:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 布伦达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut your mouth, Brenda.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.27,0:55:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不叫布伦达\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name's not Brenda.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.27,0:55:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么进来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you get in?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.94,0:56:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.94,0:56:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是马文中士 - 我知道你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sergeant Marvin… - I know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.44,0:56:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那您也一定知道我为什么会来这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you know why I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.12,0:56:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是没听见你们说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not like I don't hear what you're saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.29,0:56:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你说总统是假的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But an imposter President?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.71,0:56:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么将军说出来就听起来像疯话呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How come when the General says it, it sounds crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.88,0:56:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把真正的总统怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did they do with the real President?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.17,0:56:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们担心他已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We fear he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.55,0:56:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不这么认为 没人会杀最有利的棋子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so. You're not going to kill your best asset.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.14,0:56:39.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,康拉德·豪泽尔 公爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Conrad Hauser. Duke."
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.64,0:56:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.15,0:56:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我他是怎样一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me one thing you know about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.65,0:56:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.40,0:56:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,挚友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.99,0:56:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且他救了我的命 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he saved my life, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.04,0:57:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.58,0:57:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们说的是叛国之罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you're proposing is treason.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.92,0:57:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要更多的证据才能开展行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna need something a little more to go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.26,0:57:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,光拇指交叉这点是不够的\N{\fnArial\fs30}than overlapping thumbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.26,0:57:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在退休之前 曾经在一个安全委员会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before you retired, you served on a security commission.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.55,0:57:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,与总统的参谋长共事\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the President's Chief of Staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.72,0:57:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,科尔顿将军 你能让我们接近他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}General Colton, can you get us close?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.93,0:57:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negative.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.44,0:57:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这个城市里我不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't scratch my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.50,0:57:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,有所行动还不被监视\N{\fnArial\fs30}in this town without getting on the watch list.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.61,0:57:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,布伦达 把那支钢笔递给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brenda, hand me that pen.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.40,0:57:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才是女童子军 现在是秘书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Girl Scout to secretary.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.78,0:57:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,真棒 我不叫布伦达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amazing. Name's not Brenda.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.78,0:57:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,递支笔而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a pen.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.24,0:57:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔治敦 K大街 晚上9点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Avenue K, Georgetown. 9:00 p.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.79,0:57:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,参谋长会去那里打牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a poker game with the Chief of Staff there.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.63,0:57:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他牌打得很烂\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not a good poker player.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.29,0:57:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,破绽百出\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got 1, 000 tells.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.76,0:57:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只需要一个破绽\N{\fnArial\fs30}We only need one.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.89,0:58:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hon.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.10,0:58:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚打完牌 算是花钱买教训了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just got out of poker. Poorer but wiser.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.77,0:58:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上今天还不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a good day, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.94,0:58:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,总统又开始吃他那些奇怪的药片了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Prez was taking his crazy pills again.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.94,0:58:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 我回头打给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby, I'm gonna have to call you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.82,0:58:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.83,0:58:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.83,0:58:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要帮你提袋子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need a hand with your bags?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.33,0:58:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.46,0:58:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No problem. There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.55,0:58:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.01,0:58:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁说好男人都死光了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who said chivalry is dead, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.18,0:58:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chivalry.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.51,0:58:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是那么说 我就有麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk like that, I'm gonna get myself in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.85,0:58:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where we heading?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.06,0:58:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,就到那边的街角\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just right around the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.69,0:58:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那阵刺痛感是异戊巴比妥\N{\fnArial\fs30}That tingly feeling is amobarbital.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.74,0:58:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是能造成顺行性遗忘的镇静剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a sedative that causes anterograde amnesia.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.53,0:58:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,五分钟后你就会睡着\N{\fnArial\fs30}In five minutes, you're gonna be asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.95,0:59:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,再过五分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}In another five,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.57,0:59:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就会醒过来 根本不记得我这个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're gonna wake up with no idea I ever existed.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.17,0:59:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有发现你老大不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Notice anything strange about your boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.46,0:59:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许吧 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.63,0:59:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你得帮我们打个电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause you're gonna make a phone call for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.96,0:59:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好让我们能接近他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get us close to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.01,0:59:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过别担心 你会忘了发生的这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}But don't worry. You're gonna forget everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.68,0:59:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你的良心不会受谴责\N{\fnArial\fs30}so your conscience will be clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.68,0:59:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.85,0:59:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你你也不会相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't believe me if I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.06,0:59:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,快打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make the call.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.24,1:08:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢天谢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank God.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.34,1:08:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,总统先生最近春风得意\N{\fnArial\fs30}El Presidente is on a roll.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.18,1:08:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的数字上去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}His numbers are up.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.68,1:08:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的可不只是他的年龄\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm not just talking about his age.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.02,1:08:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是不会说我们的总司令已经老了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I'm not gonna call our Commander-in-Chief old.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.98,1:08:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上 他有一天打电话来问我的建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, he called me the other day for some advice.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.98,1:08:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 晚上好 - 晚上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good evening. - Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.98,1:08:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想把国家的核武库\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wanted to hook up the nation's nuclear arsenal.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.82,1:08:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,装上声控开关\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the Clapper.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.87,1:08:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 女士 您\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, ma'am, you're…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.16,1:08:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,迟到了 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Late, I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.87,1:08:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我耗费了一个军队的兵力才打扮好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imagine the army it takes to make me look like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.50,1:08:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,恕我无礼 我真想在那支军队的名单上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me. That's an army I'd like to enlist in.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.04,1:08:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,说到名单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speaking of lists,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.05,1:08:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,您能否解释下为什么您不在我们的名单上\N{\fnArial\fs30}would you like to explain why you're not on ours?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.55,1:09:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这儿呢 参谋长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here she is. Chief of Staff.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.68,1:09:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,玩得开心点 范德沃特小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enjoy your evening, Miss Vandervoort.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.19,1:09:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我进来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.40,1:09:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 待命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger that. Standing by.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.27,1:09:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jaye?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.07,1:09:21.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,当心点 注意安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}You keep your head down. Be safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.70,1:09:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡维尔先生友好地提到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Carville was nice enough to mention.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.24,1:09:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我热衷的事项之一 核裁军\N{\fnArial\fs30}one of my passions. Nuclear disarmament.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.53,1:09:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,几天之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}In just days,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.99,1:09:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界八大核国家的领袖\N{\fnArial\fs30}the leaders of the world's eight nuclear nations.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.95,1:09:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,将齐聚历史悠久的萨姆特堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}will gather at historic Fort Sumter.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.75,1:09:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,召开核峰会\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a nuclear summit.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.17,1:09:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是在原子八国共商大事前\N{\fnArial\fs30}But before the Atomic Eight break bread,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.76,1:09:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们先来\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's our turn.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.05,1:09:44.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 詹姆斯 非常感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, James. Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.18,1:09:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,总统先生 我是福克斯新闻的艾米·范德沃特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr President. Amy Vandervoort, Fox News.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.73,1:09:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,福克斯 当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fox, of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.02,1:09:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你看起来才那么「公平公正」（福克斯新闻的口号）\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why you look so "Fair and balanced."
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.57,1:10:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,很有趣 不过我希望能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very cute. But I was actually hoping to have a…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.32,1:10:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,跳支舞？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dance?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.44,1:10:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来想说 引用您的一句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was going to say, quote.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.36,1:10:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, here's a quote.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.78,1:10:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我的核峰会之后世界就会改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world will change after my nuclear summit.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.70,1:10:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们跳支舞怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about we dance?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.58,1:10:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的 我不会跳舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really, I don't dance.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.75,1:10:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.46,1:10:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 总统先生 您给了我所需要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Mr President. You gave me what I need.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.79,1:10:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我得回去赶稿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I really have to make my deadline.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.55,1:10:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很高兴见到您 - 谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's been a pleasure. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.26,1:10:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.85,1:10:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.52,1:10:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从他的上衣取到一根头发 希望够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a strand of hair from his jacket. I hope it's enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.53,1:10:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.11,1:10:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.57,1:10:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,等待身份验证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Standing by for I.D.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.83,1:10:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有部门 进入橙色预警 待命\N{\fnArial\fs30}All units, setting condition orange. Stand by.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.88,1:11:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不接受拒绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't take no for an answer.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.89,1:11:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,快好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost there.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.97,1:11:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油 快点 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on, come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.85,1:11:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,扎坦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zartan?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.56,1:11:21.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰伊 赶快离开那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jaye, get out of there now.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.86,1:11:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.69,1:11:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,有不明身份者 她是特种兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have an unauthorised I.D. She's a Joe.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.24,1:11:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,有特种兵出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a Joe on the premises.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.83,1:11:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jaye.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.87,1:11:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰伊 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jaye, now.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.01,1:11:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm out.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.26,1:11:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,执行B计划 去B地点会合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plan B, rendezvous Bravo.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.84,1:11:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 去C地点会合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negative. Proceed to rendezvous Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.80,1:11:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,C地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.39,1:11:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.22,1:11:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常抱歉 杰伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Jaye.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.43,1:11:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来我全盘接手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it from here.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.06,1:12:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.15,1:12:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有证据了 可以拿去给乔·科尔顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have proof. We're taking it to Joe Colton.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.07,1:12:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事你自己早已计划好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You planned this all along.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.73,1:12:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,虎爷 退下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Block, stand down.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.40,1:12:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是律师 我们是战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ain't lawyers. We're soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.24,1:12:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过要找出幕后主使\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you I was gonna find the man who did this.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.03,1:12:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打算杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was gonna kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.16,1:12:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! That's… No. Negative!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.62,1:12:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,虎爷 虎爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Block. Block.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.71,1:12:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他奶奶的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.67,1:12:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,一枪毙命\N{\fnArial\fs30}One in the chamber.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.93,1:12:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,虎爷 虎爷 你在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Block? Block, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.45,1:13:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要看的就是那表情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to see that face.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.99,1:13:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道自己死期将至的表情\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one where you realise today's the day.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.83,1:13:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,可爱的小兵们在沙漠里被我点烟花一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the face all those pretty little Joes had in the desert.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.46,1:13:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,点着时 脸上都有这个表情\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I lit them all up like fireworks!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.99,1:14:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真想看到那表情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really want to see that face.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.29,1:14:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}There it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.70,1:14:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果眼镜蛇和扎坦都在白宫里\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Cobra and Zartan are in the White House,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.20,1:14:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那世界就危险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}then the world is at stake.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.50,1:14:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,白幽灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Storm Shadow.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.87,1:14:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,说出眼镜蛇的最终计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will tell us Cobra's endgame,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.04,1:14:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然就用你杀害师傅的刀将你斩杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}or die by the same sword you once used to kill our master.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.74,1:14:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your sword,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.87,1:15:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们敬爱的哈德大师赐予你的刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}given to you by our beloved Hard Master.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.25,1:15:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是否承认 是嫉妒与憎恨让你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you deny that your envy and hatred drove you to shed.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.87,1:15:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀害了哈德大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Hard Master's blood?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.13,1:15:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,当憎恨多到无以复加\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's possible to feel so much hate.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.26,1:15:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,便会对之麻木\N{\fnArial\fs30}you stop feeling it at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.43,1:15:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像鱼在水中而不自知\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a fish not knowing it's in water.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.56,1:15:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我的宿命早已被他人注定\N{\fnArial\fs30}But my path was chosen for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.44,1:15:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括我的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}by my enemy.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.77,1:15:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们杀害哈德大师后嫁祸于我\N{\fnArial\fs30}who framed me for killing the Hard Master.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.24,1:15:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.16,1:15:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信这骗局的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}who believed it.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.70,1:15:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,对双眼被蒙蔽之人 为何徒劳去辩解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why defend yourself to men too blind to see?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.29,1:15:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,血是哈德大师的没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is the Hard Master's blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.97,1:15:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那把\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that is not…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.85,1:16:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.39,1:16:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我的刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}my sword.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.40,1:16:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,岚影一族之刃是不会断的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arashikage steel does not break.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.41,1:16:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一遍又一遍地自问\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have asked myself over and over.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.58,1:16:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁如此蔑视我 甚至要毁我一生\N{\fnArial\fs30}who despised me enough to destroy my life?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.50,1:16:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 白幽灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am sorry, Storm Shadow.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.96,1:16:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但陷害你之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}But who would stand to gain the most.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.52,1:16:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是最大的得利者呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}by framing you for this crime?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.80,1:16:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,令你亡命天涯的年轻对手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your young adversary who chased you away?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.15,1:16:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是将落魄的你收留的那人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or the man into whose arms you were chased.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.36,1:17:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那人接纳了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone who welcomed you,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.15,1:17:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好心对你\N{\fnArial\fs30}showed you kindness.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.78,1:17:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他需要我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He needed me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.28,1:17:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我将成为那种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}For who I would become.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.54,1:17:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,成为身怀绝技的愤怒勇士\N{\fnArial\fs30}A warrior of great skill and anger.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.88,1:17:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,陷害我的人诡计多端\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man who betrayed me was capable of great ingenuity,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.17,1:17:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,崇尚暴力\N{\fnArial\fs30}violence,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.60,1:17:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,更重要的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}but most of all,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.68,1:17:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,善于伪装\N{\fnArial\fs30}disguise.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.85,1:17:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,扎坦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zartan.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.02,1:17:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.61,1:17:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我们他和眼镜蛇的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell us what he and Cobra have planned.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.15,1:17:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好让我们齐心协力歼灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we can destroy our common enemy.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.66,1:17:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,共同的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}together.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.54,1:17:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try to hold still.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.58,1:17:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要不要再说一遍指关节该怎么攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to remind me how knuckles are supposed to strike again?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.17,1:18:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,要团结一致\N{\fnArial\fs30}Together.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.46,1:18:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些都是你说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those were your words.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.72,1:18:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我只是见机行事 - 别掩饰\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I had a shot and I took it. - Now, don't give me that!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.30,1:18:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经胡来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You went rogue.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.39,1:18:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还会这样做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'd do it again.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.43,1:18:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 接下来你还有什么大计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? And what was your big plan, then, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.85,1:18:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,去自杀吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get yourself killed?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.68,1:18:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的老天爷啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.54,1:18:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你唯命是从\N{\fnArial\fs30}I listened to everything you said over and over again.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.02,1:18:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来不过问\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never questioned…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.23,1:18:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想再牺牲战友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't going to bury any more Joes.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.87,1:18:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要大开杀戒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got guns to clean.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.68,1:18:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我拉下拉链\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me out here?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.98,1:19:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.17,1:19:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我爸能看到我现在的样子就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If my dad could see me now…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.42,1:19:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.59,1:19:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一定不相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wouldn't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.84,1:19:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.43,1:19:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我家三代从军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Third generation military.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.68,1:19:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他做梦都想第四代也从军 然后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Desperately wanted a fourth, and.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.73,1:19:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈就生了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}my mom had me.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.36,1:19:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他一定很为你感到骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he must be real proud of you, then.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.19,1:19:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不信任女军人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't believe in female soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.11,1:19:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我终于鼓起勇气问他原因时 他说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I finally asked him why. He said.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.20,1:19:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不想将自己的性命交到一个女人手上\N{\fnArial\fs30}he didn't want to put his life in the hands of a woman.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.62,1:20:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二天我就入伍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I enlisted the next day.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.04,1:20:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,努力了七年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spent the next seven years.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.55,1:20:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,只为了军衔超过他 好让他向我敬礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}trying to outrank him so he'd have to salute me.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.76,1:20:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did it work?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.98,1:20:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那之前他就去世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He died before I got the chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.90,1:20:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.25,1:20:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会怀念刚才穿红衣的你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm actually gonna miss the red.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.05,1:20:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你美极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look real nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.63,1:20:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了 要大开杀戒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. I said we got guns to clean.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.93,1:20:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这世界自己救不了自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world ain't saving itself.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.69,1:21:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那一下是因为你的加税法案\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was for the tax hike.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.65,1:21:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得好像你缴过税似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you pay taxes.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.98,1:21:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是替众人不平\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't always about me.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.98,1:21:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Hey, hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.03,1:21:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,留着他还有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}We still need the man.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.37,1:21:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,况且 打在他身 痛在我心啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, we've grown close.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.66,1:21:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,白幽灵能来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is Storm Shadow in?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.66,1:21:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不用担心他 他一定能来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you worry about him. He'll be more than ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.00,1:21:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的内阁班子看来不怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not too impressed with your Cabinet.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.51,1:21:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,又没通过听证会 凑合着用吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No confirmation hearings, that's what you get.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.55,1:21:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.34,1:21:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,由我来接手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take it from here.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.26,1:21:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制这个手提箱的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He who controls this briefcase,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.56,1:21:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能控制美国核武库\N{\fnArial\fs30}controls the U.S. nuclear arsenal.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.35,1:21:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及全人类的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the fate of humanity.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.19,1:21:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,张开眼睛 前总统先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open your eyes, Mr Ex-President.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.78,1:21:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼睛是心灵的窗户\N{\fnArial\fs30}The eyes are the windows to the soul.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.28,1:21:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,张大点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open up.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.70,1:21:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,宙斯已经造好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zeus is ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.66,1:22:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,万事俱备 只欠东风\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just need one final piece of the puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.42,1:22:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well done.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.88,1:22:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,历史自有公断\N{\fnArial\fs30}History will stand in judgment.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.72,1:22:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜断的不是我 是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not of me. Of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.18,1:22:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况如何 杰伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we got, Jaye?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.73,1:22:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,扎坦全神贯注于这个核峰会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zartan's entire focus has been this nuclear summit.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.40,1:22:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一定是他计划的关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has to be the key to whatever he's planning.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.19,1:22:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那就是我们的目标了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Well, then that's our target.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.03,1:22:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.70,1:22:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, move.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.05,1:23:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次我比你快了 蛇眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'm faster than you, Snake Eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.56,1:23:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的忍者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn Ninjas.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.31,1:23:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你太好了 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to see you, brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.27,1:23:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是杰伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jaye.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.07,1:23:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是金克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jinx.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.40,1:23:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back up.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.20,1:23:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我们这边的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's with us.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.83,1:23:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不是你们这边的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.66,1:23:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是这一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}But for this once,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.83,1:23:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是敌人而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not against you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.46,1:23:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他杀了我们多少人\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many of our men has he killed?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.50,1:23:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们难道要和他并肩作战吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're supposed to fight with him?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.51,1:23:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界各国的首脑明天将召集 那是陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}The leaders of the world will gather tomorrow. It's a trap.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.64,1:23:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有白幽灵知道眼镜蛇的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Storm is the only one who knows Cobra's plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.81,1:23:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他了如指掌 能帮我们设法阻止那计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}inside and out. He can help us find a way to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.73,1:23:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们必须合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we have to work together.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.82,1:23:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.65,1:23:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's move.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.58,1:24:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.59,1:24:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞不好你的邻居也藏了不少货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Makes you wonder about your neighbours.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.27,1:24:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,帅气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.41,1:24:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,翻开那个沙发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open up that couch.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.29,1:24:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,有需要吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.54,1:24:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自有准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}I brought my own.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.96,1:24:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.23,1:25:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是它了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that'll work.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.24,1:25:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那支是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That one's mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.58,1:25:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真是巴顿将军的枪 没错吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This really is Patton's gun, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.24,1:25:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他家人送我的礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gift from his family.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.75,1:25:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,无上的荣耀\N{\fnArial\fs30}What an honour.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.67,1:25:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bet.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.75,1:25:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在考虑给你弄个配得上你的大家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was actually thinking about something a little more your size.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.26,1:25:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,可别给我刮花了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try not to scratch her up.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.93,1:25:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,挂空档时候会有点问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Idles a little rough in neutral.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.06,1:25:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不挂空档\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't gonna be in neutral.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.82,1:25:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.57,1:26:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,国防部说我不可以复出\N{\fnArial\fs30}DOD says I can't come out of retirement.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.41,1:26:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可没说我不能重新入伍\N{\fnArial\fs30}They didn't say anything about reenlisting.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.29,1:26:16.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,向你报到 军士长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reporting for duty, Sergeant Major.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.46,1:26:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想带上一群老伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to bring a couple friends of mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.38,1:26:22.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,科尔顿的队伍 很荣幸见到你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colton's team, it's our honour.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.55,1:26:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们负责守边界\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys take the perimeter.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.67,1:26:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,火石 杰伊 蛇眼 你们负责边翼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flint, Jaye, Snake, you guys take the flank.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.14,1:26:28.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,金克斯和白幽灵 你们做内应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jinx and Storm, Trojan Horse.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.05,1:26:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,扎坦会提着手提箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zartan will be holding the briefcase.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.10,1:26:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,白幽灵会是最接近他的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Storm will be the closest man to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.89,1:26:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但直到我们都就位 他才能行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he can't move until we're all in position.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.73,1:26:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都给我盯着手提箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone keep your eye on the prize.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.52,1:26:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,抢到它 世界就安全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We secure the football, we secure the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.65,1:26:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,蛇眼 觉得怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snake, how's all that sound?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.07,1:26:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I thought.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.11,1:26:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍微等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, wait. Hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.32,1:26:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里 这里和这里仍然有敌人的装甲车\N{\fnArial\fs30}We still have enemy armour here, here, and here.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.20,1:26:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.33,1:26:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些坦克不除 我们就完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}These tanks survive, we don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.46,1:26:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,坦克我来解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave the tanks to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.71,1:26:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}General?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.83,1:26:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫我乔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call me Joe.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.42,1:27:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我有遗漏吗 - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Anything I missed? - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.30,1:27:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,滴水不漏 我的任务是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rock solid. My orders?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.63,1:27:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,解救总统\N{\fnArial\fs30}The President.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.47,1:27:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 布伦达和我一组 - 收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Brenda's with my team. - Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.01,1:27:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,布伦达有权选择吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does Brenda get a vote?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.97,1:27:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negative.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.19,1:27:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又需要人递笔吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need a pen?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.90,1:27:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你的一臂之力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.27,1:27:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.86,1:27:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们大干一场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's kick that ass! Hoo-ah!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.41,1:27:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这历史性的一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}A historic day.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.73,1:27:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国总统将会见\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the President of the United States as he meets with…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.87,1:27:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天下午 总统将会见\N{\fnArial\fs30}This afternoon, the President is meeting with.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.87,1:27:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,八大核国家的领袖\N{\fnArial\fs30}the leaders of the eight nuclear powers.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.37,1:27:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,从未有哪位总统如此大胆地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never before has a President been so bold.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.37,1:27:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,邀请所有领导人同聚一堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}to call the leaders of the world together…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.71,1:27:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种史无前例的核会谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are unprecedented nuclear talks that.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.50,1:27:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,以往被认为永远不可能发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}most believed would never happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.59,1:27:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫无疑问 会谈的警戒将是最高级别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can bet security is at its highest…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.51,1:27:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也许比任何时期更接近无核世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}We may be closer to a nuclear-free world than we have ever been.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.30,1:27:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位领导人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My fellow world leaders,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.60,1:27:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到萨姆特堡的神圣土地\N{\fnArial\fs30}welcome to the hallowed grounds of Fort Sumter,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.81,1:27:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们国家万恶的内战\N{\fnArial\fs30}whose proud walls saw the first shots.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.16,1:28:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是在这里打响了第一枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}in our nation's grievous Civil War.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.69,1:28:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们曾在这里疯狂地穿过工事上的缺口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, men rushed through the breach in a madness.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.03,1:28:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果我们退一步 摒弃自己的恶欲\N{\fnArial\fs30}What better place to step back from that same breach.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.86,1:28:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,原谅我们的死敌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Renounce our darker natures.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.03,1:28:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个世界将变得更美好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive our staunchest foes.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.45,1:28:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是一个象征\N{\fnArial\fs30}This site is symbolic.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.92,1:28:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不仅仅象征着我们谋求的和平\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not only for the peace we seek to achieve,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.79,1:28:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,也象征着我们要避免的灾难\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the conflagration we seek to avoid.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.09,1:28:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现今的卫士眼镜蛇部队坚信\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Cobras who protect us today are dedicated to the belief.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.51,1:28:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,心态的平和才是最高境界的和平\N{\fnArial\fs30}that there is no greater peace than peace of mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.81,1:28:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.89,1:28:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再说一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll say it again.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.48,1:28:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,核武器的存在能让世界更安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world is safer with a nuclear presence.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.65,1:28:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信你的选民也会满意我们的最终提案\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure your electorate will be happy by our final proposal.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.24,1:28:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,2016年前裁减至一半\N{\fnArial\fs30}50% reduction by 2016.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.16,1:28:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,在场有许多国家的领袖\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are a lot of leaders in this room.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.66,1:29:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,但只有一位来自自由世界的领导人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But only one leader of the free world.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.17,1:29:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,而他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.17,1:29:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是我本人 别走神\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, stay with me,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.34,1:29:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,要求在座各位全面销毁核武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}asked you here with the goal of universal disarmament.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.43,1:29:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,共创无核世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nuclear zero.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.51,1:29:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来打算来软的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I was prepared to cajole to get what I want.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.93,1:29:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我要来硬的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm now at threaten.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.77,1:29:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人立即销毁所有库存核武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Each of you will clear out his nuclear closet immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.48,1:29:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不照做的将被视为宣战行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Failure to participate will be considered an act of war.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.40,1:29:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're joking, of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.95,1:29:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次峰会结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This summit is over.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.53,1:29:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就到此为止吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then this is it.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.12,1:29:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,到此为止了 小子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it, boys.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.74,1:29:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个国家向你们宣战\N{\fnArial\fs30}This country is at war.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.08,1:29:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,向你 你 你 你 还有你\N{\fnArial\fs30}With you and you and you and you and you and you.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.26,1:29:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,D队就位 E队 开始行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Delta team in position. Echo, you're a go.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.64,1:30:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是E队 准备进攻\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Echo. Beginning assault.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.81,1:30:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国核武库\N{\fnArial\fs30}The U.S. nuclear arsenal.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.94,1:30:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,足以把你们每个国家摧毁14次以上\N{\fnArial\fs30}is capable of destroying each of your countries 14 times over.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.44,1:30:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,确切的说 能摧毁朝鲜15次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fifteen, in the case of North Korea, just to be sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.07,1:30:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.58,1:30:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,只需按下\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the push.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.58,1:30:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个按钮\N{\fnArial\fs30}of a button.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.55,1:30:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's true.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.89,1:30:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我按下去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I pressed it.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.52,1:30:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have lost your mind!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.39,1:30:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是相对而言\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all relative.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.48,1:30:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你们3分钟时间考虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got three minutes to decide.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.94,1:30:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你轮下一班吗 - 无线电保持静音\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You got next watch? - Maintain radio silence.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.71,1:31:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能再坐视不理\N{\fnArial\fs30}We cannot, we will not leave a legacy of acquiescence!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.76,1:31:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手提箱拿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring the briefcase.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.35,1:31:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do this!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.98,1:31:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这对谁都没好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}There can be no winners!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.11,1:31:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,最高分啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}High score.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.36,1:31:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,历史会见证 谁该为这疯狂之举负责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let history record who was responsible for this madness.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.74,1:31:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}Launch.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.64,1:32:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}Launch.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.70,1:32:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,已看到翡翠城\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eyes on the Emerald City.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.37,1:32:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰伊和科尔顿 总统解救行动开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jaye and Colton, you're a go for POTUS.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.38,1:32:30.38,Note,0,0,0,0,,（总统行宫）
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.97,1:32:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.35,1:32:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. You all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.19,1:32:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,胆固醇有点高\N{\fnArial\fs30}My cholesterol's a little high.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.19,1:32:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是杰伊和科尔顿将军 搞定岗哨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jaye and General Colton. Checkpoint neutralised.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.86,1:33:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,自已保重\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're on your own.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.21,1:33:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好消息是下个月不用开全球变暖峰会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the good news is, no global warming summit next month.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.50,1:33:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.17,1:33:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们其中有人在意他的历史地位\N{\fnArial\fs30}one of us cared enough about his place in history.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.68,1:33:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿意单方面摧毁自己的弹头\N{\fnArial\fs30}to unilaterally disable his warheads.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.93,1:33:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,就当是为了子孙后代\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, in the name of the children.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.68,1:33:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人要自告奋勇吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any volunteers?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.68,1:33:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有吗 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No? Fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.64,1:33:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.87,1:33:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,打电话确认一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call your people to confirm.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.20,1:33:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是个疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a complete lunatic.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.20,1:33:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,将要摧毁亚洲的可是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Says the man about to destroy Asia.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.75,1:33:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人跟风吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, who's going to follow suit, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.42,1:33:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们打算眼睁睁地看着地球毁灭吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you really going to stand by and watch as Earth is destroyed?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.05,1:34:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们终止\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abort!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.05,1:34:03.17,Note,0,0,0,0,,（法国 洲际导弹已毁）
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.27,1:34:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,估计就剩朝鲜没按了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figured North Korea for last.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.11,1:34:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,小伙子真讨人喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got to love the little guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.53,1:34:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.20,1:34:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到无核世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to a nuclear-free world.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.12,1:34:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,留心看你们祖国的实况图像\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to direct your attention to live images of your homelands.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.05,1:34:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在大家看到的是一套先进的武器系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you're looking at an advanced weapons system.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.97,1:34:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫宙斯计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}we call Project Zeus.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.10,1:34:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,一共有7颗宙斯卫星环绕地球飞行\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are seven Zeus satellites orbiting Earth.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.77,1:34:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,每颗卫星都有10根中空的铂金管\N{\fnArial\fs30}Each satellite contains 10 hollow platinum tubes.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.65,1:34:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,每根管里填充着一根钨棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}filled with a tungsten rod.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.02,1:35:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,宙斯卫星1A到达伦敦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zeus satellite 1-A approaching London.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.53,1:35:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备就绪 等待空投批准\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ordnance live and loaded. Awaiting drop authorisation.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.49,1:35:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了让钨条击中目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, to direct a rod to its target,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.81,1:35:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不需要发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}we don't launch it or fire it.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.16,1:35:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们进行空投\N{\fnArial\fs30}We drop it!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.46,1:35:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,只靠重力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gravity does the rest.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.30,1:35:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,看好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Observe.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.34,1:35:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,卫星1A 已获远程发射批准\N{\fnArial\fs30}Satellite 1-A. We have remote launch authorisation.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.68,1:35:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,三 二 一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three, two, one,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.85,1:35:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,投放\N{\fnArial\fs30}drop.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.31,1:35:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,钨棒到达地面的速度比子弹快8倍\N{\fnArial\fs30}A rod touches down eight times faster than a bullet.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.69,1:35:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀伤力也远超于核弹头\N{\fnArial\fs30}And with a force significantly greater than a nuclear warhead.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.86,1:35:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会产生放射性尘埃\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of the fallout.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.37,1:35:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有无限的乐趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of the fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.52,1:36:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须对此负责\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will have to answer for this.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.14,1:36:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的国会和法院会追究你的责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}To your Congress, your courts.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.90,1:36:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,错了 是他们要听我的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Correction, they will have to answer to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.57,1:36:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.15,1:36:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want it all.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.93,1:36:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼镜蛇革命开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Cobra revolution has begun.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.02,1:37:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,扎坦按下按钮后已启动自动投放程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}By pressing that button, Zartan initiated an auto-drop sequence.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.94,1:37:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的宙斯卫星正向着\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Zeus satellites are moving into position.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.82,1:37:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,其余6个国家飞去\N{\fnArial\fs30}over your six remaining countries.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:08.03,1:37:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,卫星2A至7A正前往目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Satellites 2-A through 7-A en route to targets.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.61,1:37:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,按下同一个键 就能终止这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}The same button that begins this can end it.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.03,1:37:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过要付出代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I only press it for a price.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.04,1:37:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是绝对的臣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Total allegiance.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.76,1:37:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,虎爷 搞定外围的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Block, secure the perimeter!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.36,1:37:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,从扎坦那儿把控制箱拿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the control case from Zartan.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.61,1:37:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把他们全灭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to drop them all.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.66,1:37:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,往大门跑 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Head for the door, now! Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.82,1:38:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,卫星正飞往目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Satellites en route to targets.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.82,1:38:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始执行指令程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beginning command protocols.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.03,1:39:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟着地面部队 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow that ground team! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.54,1:39:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.51,1:39:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你的六点钟方向 眼镜蛇2号\N{\fnArial\fs30}On your six, Cobra two!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.40,1:39:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼镜蛇1号 我无法锁定目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cobra one, Cobra one, I need eyes on! Eyes on!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.29,1:40:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,惨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:18.26,1:40:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把她逼到角落了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got her cornered.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:19.28,1:40:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,她走投无路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She ain't go anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.83,1:40:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:12.81,1:41:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,白幽灵 没想到你加入了特种部队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Storm. I never figured you for a Joe.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.77,1:41:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你太失望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm very disappointed in you.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.71,1:41:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还真难打中\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a bitch to hit.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.39,1:42:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,叛徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Traitor.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:38.90,1:42:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,白幽灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Storm.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.98,1:42:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这把刀从来不适合\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, this sword was never intended.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.74,1:42:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制不了自己怒火的人使用\N{\fnArial\fs30}for anyone with anger management issues.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.60,1:43:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么声音 - 别吵\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What was that? - Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:20.69,1:43:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 雷 - 是的 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ray? - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.11,1:43:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,去门口看一下 回来汇报情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check the door. Give me a sit rep.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:23.69,1:43:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这就去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:40.00,1:43:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩守住入口\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two secure the entrance.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:03.73,1:44:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要干嘛 - 跟我走 离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing? - Let's go. We're out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:06.74,1:44:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,别过来 不然我就开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand down. I'm gonna shoot him!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.57,1:44:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了别过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said stand down!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.74,1:44:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,乖乖放下武器 让我们离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be a good G.I. Joe and drop the gun. We're walking out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:16.54,1:44:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然我就朝他脑袋开枪 听见没\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will shoot him in the head. Do you understand me?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:18.25,1:44:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都聋了吗 把枪放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not listening, are you? Put the gun down!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:20.17,1:44:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,丢掉武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop them.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:29.93,1:44:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了 放轻松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy, easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:32.18,1:44:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,按住伤口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put some pressure on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:33.80,1:44:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,科尔顿将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}General Colton.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.56,1:44:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很高兴见到你 - 我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's good to see you. - Good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:37.35,1:44:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 总统先生 - 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry, Mr President. - No, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:39.60,1:44:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's move.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:41.19,1:44:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:42.73,1:44:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,拦路虎 总统获救 无人伤亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roadblock, POTUS secure. No casualties.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:47.86,1:44:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到了 杰伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger that, Jaye.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:56.66,1:44:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你背叛了哈德大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}You betrayed the Hard Master.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:01.67,1:45:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,还把我变成了今天这个样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And made me what I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:03.42,1:45:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:04.92,1:45:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也知道那是错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I can see that was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:31.61,1:45:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要尽快找到萤火虫和眼镜蛇\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need eyes on Firefly and Cobra ASAP.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:46.75,1:45:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,院子找遍了 没看见他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Courtyard clear. No sign of him.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:52.34,1:45:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,指挥官 我拿到箱子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commander, I have the case.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.68,1:45:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,可按原计划进行\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are still a go.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:56.30,1:45:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,离空投还有多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long till drop?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:58.31,1:46:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,与原计划相符 指挥官 还有五分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}On schedule, Commander. Five minutes to live fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:01.35,1:46:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,最终锁定即将开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Final targeting to begin shortly.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:02.52,1:46:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,宙斯卫星4号和7号已就位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zeus satellites 4 and 7 in position.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:09.73,1:46:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,卫星2 3 5 6号已锁定目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zeus satellites 2, 3, 5, and 6 are locked on target.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:14.53,1:46:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,法国 俄罗斯 朝鲜\N{\fnArial\fs30}France, Russia, North Korea,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:16.32,1:46:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,印度 以色列 中国\N{\fnArial\fs30}India, Israel, China.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:41.18,1:46:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,虎爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Block.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.10,1:46:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼镜蛇指挥官逃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cobra Commander's bugging out.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:44.52,1:46:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,没看见萤火虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}No sign of Firefly.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.27,1:46:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got him.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.37,1:47:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标已锁定 武器装载中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Targets acquired. Ordnance live and loading.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:04.58,1:47:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,宙斯4号已做好发射准备 舱口已打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zeus 4 is ready to fire. Hatch is open.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:20.43,1:47:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 搞定他 - 干掉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get him! - Take him out!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:23.24,1:48:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要拿箱子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want that case?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:25.37,1:48:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,先得过我这一关\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna have to come through me.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:30.42,1:48:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:45.01,1:48:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有卫星开始装弹 准备倒计时\N{\fnArial\fs30}All satellites have begun load for final countdown.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:49.66,1:49:50.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,发射密码确认\N{\fnArial\fs30}Launch codes confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:52.71,1:49:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒数10秒发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten seconds to live fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:55.67,1:49:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,十\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:57.00,1:49:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,九\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nine.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:58.42,1:49:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,八\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:00.09,1:50:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,七 六\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seven. Six.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:02.80,1:50:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,五\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:03.97,1:50:05.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,四\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:05.39,1:50:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,三\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:06.85,1:50:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,二\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:10.14,1:50:10.73,Note,0,0,0,0,,（手控终止）
Dialogue: 0,1:50:25.45,1:50:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,危机解除\N{\fnArial\fs30}Threat terminated.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:28.62,1:50:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,B队 外围已安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Team Bravo, perimeter has been cleared and secured.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:51.95,1:51:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是特种部队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joe Command to covert operations.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:53.79,1:51:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已控制外围\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have control of the perimeter.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:55.95,1:51:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,医护人员已到场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Medical personnel are on the scene.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.87,1:51:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有特种兵已归队\N{\fnArial\fs30}All Joes are accounted for.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.21,1:52:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going home.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:11.59,1:52:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,总统今日已安全回到总统办公室\N{\fnArial\fs30}The President is back safe in the Oval Office today,
Dialogue: 0,1:52:13.89,1:52:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,为特种部队主持表彰典礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}presiding over a ceremony honouring the G.I. Joes.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:16.31,1:52:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,随着世界恢复秩序\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the world back in order,
Dialogue: 0,1:52:17.86,1:52:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,各地重建工作也已经展开\N{\fnArial\fs30}rebuilding has begun around the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:20.23,1:52:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些站在我们身边的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those who stand beside us,
Dialogue: 0,1:52:22.65,1:52:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,世人只知他们是特种部队\N{\fnArial\fs30}the world knows them as Joes.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:26.40,1:52:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还知道 他们是英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know them as heroes.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:34.08,1:52:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,金克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jinx.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:36.08,1:52:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎加入特种部队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the Joes.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:39.00,1:52:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,火石\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flint.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:40.46,1:52:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great job.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:46.09,1:52:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰伊·伯内特上尉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain Jaye Burnett.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:53.18,1:52:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你父亲是战友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I served with your father.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:57.81,1:52:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会为你感到骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd be very proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:10.65,1:53:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们 先生们 向特种部队致敬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen, the G.I. Joes.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:28.51,1:53:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,留给你找到眼镜蛇指挥官的时候用\N{\fnArial\fs30}For when you find Cobra Commander.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:39.81,1:53:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,去哪里能找到你 将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where can we find you, General?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:42.27,1:53:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我下命令就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just need my orders.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:44.19,1:53:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的组合可是所向无敌\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, we'd make a hell of a team.
